Some lines below is this code:

```cpp
         if (FD_ISSET(s, &err)) {
             events.occurred |= ErrorEvent;
         }       
```
which handles the outcome of `select(2)`. Is it true that with this PR that would be no-op on non-Windows? Because we only `FD_SET(s, &err)` on Windows. If yes, then consider also putting it inside `#ifdef WIN32` to make that more clear.

